      "message": "This isn\u0027t a big deal but the point was to return an error and centralize logging at the call site (as opposed to logging across the code base).\n\n `DebugPolicyError` would wrap a `FdtError` and its `Display` would\n```\nDebugPolicyError(e) \u003d\u003e write!(f, \"Error in Debug Policy DT: {e}\")\n```\n\nYes, this loses part of the context but makes the code leaner; WDYT? Happy to drop this recommendation, if you like.",
