      "message": "Could you `impl fmt::Display for DebugPolicyError` and `warn!(\"...: {e}\")` it inside this `map_err`, which would centralize the logging of these errors (I\u0027ve added comments where this could be used in the implementation).\n\nBTW, I don\u0027t think you actually want to \"translate\" these to `RebootReason`s (see comment about `?`) but if you did, `impl From\u003cDebugPolicyError\u003e for RebootReason` would probably be the right way.",
