      "writtenOn": "2023-01-20T16:36:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Re: `impl fmt::Display for DebugPolicyError`: It seems unnecessary. I\u0027ve logged extra details when I return error in `handle_debug_policy()`, so logging error here seemed to be an unnecessary duplication. Do you prefer to log here or inside the `debug_policy.rs`?\n\nDone for `impl From\u003cDebugPolicyError\u003e`.",
      "parentUuid": "28b1531b_708ac1d8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 258,
        "startChar": 69,
        "endLine": 258,
        "endChar": 76
      },
      "revId": "7ac3b225fa2cf67bb2b2895ab578926a7cab617d",
