      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-01-31T13:51:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As mentioned in my other comment, the point is to avoid sprinkling logging calls everywhere by centralizing it at a higher-level call site. Implementing `fmt::Display` allows us to write logging code that\u0027s flexible e.g.\n```\n.map_err(|e| {\n    error!(\"Unexpected error: {e}\");\n    TopLevelError::E\n})?;\n```\nwhere `e` can be any of the variants its `enum` allows.",
      "parentUuid": "6d0b4621_3e713ab8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 258,
        "startChar": 69,
        "endLine": 258,
        "endChar": 76
      },
      "revId": "7ac3b225fa2cf67bb2b2895ab578926a7cab617d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
